{"version":1,"content":"<p>賣座韓片《與神同行》的48歲韓國影帝河正宇，上月宣布結束王老五生涯，與相戀多年的37歲女演員車貞媛拉埋天窗。</p><p>兩人將下月13日在首爾新羅酒店舉行婚禮，喜帖近日亦隨之曝光。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;喜帖以兩人的真名金聖勳、車美</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:23:57.873886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:03:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.558510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.558510+00:00","content_hash":"e569245b7d7b0ebd59771dca853f120a86c7bc4df01c216e93e3c3422341ff3c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}